Bootstrap: docker
From: ubuntu:24.04

%labels
    Author Geoffrey Weal
    Version 1.0.0
    Description "Container holding a 'secret' message, used for the encryption exercises"

%runscript
    echo "This is the secret message hidden inside the container!"

%help
    This is the container used in the encryption exercises.

    Usage:
        apptainer run --passphrase secret.sif

    What it does:
        Prints a "secret" message to stdout. In a real case the contents would
        be proprietary code or sensitive data that you want to keep encrypted.
